### 3. Additional context (if relevant):
Selection criteria applied:
- Population: Childhood cancer survivors (treated before age 21)
- Intervention: Cisplatin, carboplatin, ifosfamide, radiation to kidney region, nephrectomy, or combinations
- Outcome: Renal function reported 1+ year after treatment cessation
- Study design: All except case reports, case series, <20 participants
- Conservative approach: When in doubt, INCLUDE

Key exclusion reasons:
- Adult population (not childhood cancer)
- No renal function outcomes reported
- Case reports/case series
- Methodological/review articles without original data
- Acute toxicity only (not long-term)
- Non-nephrotoxic treatments

Key inclusion reasons:
- Pediatric population with nephrotoxic treatment
- Renal function outcomes reported
- Long-term follow-up data available
- Relevant risk factor analysis

