EXCLUSION REASONS SUMMARY:
- Review articles/methodological papers: ~25 studies
- Adult populations (not childhood cancer): ~15 studies
- No renal function outcome: ~15 studies
- Sample size <20: ~5 studies
- Case reports/case series: ~5 studies
- Wrong treatment exposure (no nephrotoxic agents): ~5 studies

