   - Study 156 (20 patients ifosfamide): Exactly at minimum threshold
   - Study 200 (methodological): Included because it provides renal function data in cancer patients

5. DATA QUALITY: Most included studies have adequate follow-up (>1 year post-treatment) and clear treatment exposure 
documentation.
