│ {'chunk_data': '{"title": "Early and late adverse renal effects after potentially nephrotoxic treatment for          │
│ childhood cancer", "objective": "To evaluate existing evidence on the effects of potentially nephrotoxic treatment   │
│ modalities on the prevalence of renal dysfunction in survivors treated for childhood cancer with a median or mean    │
