│ serious and apparently irreversible side effect."}, {"study_index": 469, "title": "Multidisciplinary approach to     │
│ Wilms\' tumor: a retrospective analytical study of 53 patients", "abstract": "AIM OF THE WORK The aim of this work   │
│ was to assess the epidemiologic aspects, clinico-pathological features and the results of multidisciplinary          │
│ treatment of Wilms\' tumor (WT) in pediatric patients treated at the National Cancer Institute (NCI), Cairo          │
